abstract: >
  Lecture slides for the ETH Zürich Innovedum-funded course on AI-assisted
  scientific programming in Python and collaborative software development with Git.
  The course covers AI coding tools, Git workflows, Python best practices,
  testing, packaging, and object-oriented programming.
